{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20925","headline":"感讽五首 二 · 李贺","name":"感讽五首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"奇俊无少年，日车何躃躃。\n我待纡双绶，遗我星星发。\n都门贾生墓，青蝇久断绝。\n寒食摇扬天，愤景长肃杀。\n皇汉十二帝，唯帝称睿哲。\n一夕信竖儿，文明永沦歇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20925.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20925","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}